(o) The sitio of Tuburan is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Tuburan;
(p) The sitio of Pangpang is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Pangpang;
(q) The sitio of Garrido (Laray Gamay) is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Garrido;
(r) The sitio of Juson (Sangoraan) is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Juson;
(s) The sitio of Patag (Benog) is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Patag;
(t) The sitio of Pagatpat (Near Bunacan) is converted into a distinct and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as Barrio Pagatpat;
